/**
 * Trigger Action (TAF 0.3.4) that creates an onboarding Task for the owner of a newly
 * created Account whose Type is a direct or channel customer type.
 *
 * Bulk-safe: collects all qualifying Tasks across the trigger batch and performs a single
 * insert. Performs no DML when no Account qualifies.
 *
 * Registered via Trigger_Action__mdt record TA_Account_CreateOnboardingTask (Order 10,
 * After Insert on the Account sObject_Trigger_Setting__mdt record).
